+/* ============================================================================
+   Launch console — a live feed shown while the machine / Minecraft boot
+   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+   Two kinds of lines:
+     REAL lines   (● ✓ ✗ ›)  come from actual events: machine state from the
+                             Worker, and Minecraft's own console output.
+     FLAVOR lines (~)        are PLACEHOLDERS that fill the quiet gaps so the
+                             screen never freezes. They don't claim anything
+                             technical. Swap them for real hooks whenever you like.
+   >>> To change what the feed says, edit BOOT_FLAVOR and BOOT_TIPS below. <<<
+   ========================================================================== */
+const BOOT_FLAVOR = {
+  cloud: [
+    'asking the cloud very nicely for a machine…',
+    'waking the hamsters that power the servers…',
+    'unrolling a long extension cord to the datacenter…',
+    'polishing the CPU (it likes that)…',
+    'reticulating splines…',
+    'checking the weather in the cloud… it is cloudy',
