+    'counting creepers… there are too many',
+    'teaching the cows to spawn politely…',
+    'placing the bedrock, layer by layer…',
+    'hiding diamonds somewhere deep…',
+    'asking the villagers to please stop wandering off…',
+    'letting the sheep choose their colours…',
+  ],
+};
+const BOOT_TIPS = [
